	(text "RK3588 units 12 (system) and 6 (GPIO bank 0), from the Radxa Rock 5B v1.45 schematic, sheets 11, 13, 15 and 19.\nIO bank voltages as the reference: banks on VCCIO5 and VCCIO6 run at 3.3 V, PMUIO2 at 3.3 V, the rest at 1.8 V.\nBoot select (SARADC_IN0) has only the 100K pull-up: boot order SPI flash, eMMC, SD, USB. Shorting J to ground\nforces USB download mode. No SD card slot and no SPI flash on this board, so their pins are left open.\nPMUIO and memory VDD1 use VCC_1V8_S3 directly (the reference has a zero-ohm link to VCC1V8_PMU_DDR_S3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
